1
00:00:06,208 --> 00:00:09,375
In breaking news,
Chairman Huang of Ching He Temple,

2
00:00:09,458 --> 00:00:11,750
who is currently being held in detention,

3
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:14,083
was found dead in his cell today.

4
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:18,708
Our preliminary investigation suggests
the cause of death was cardiac arrest.

5
00:00:18,791 --> 00:00:22,750
An autopsy has ruled out homicide,
but this is yet to be officially…

6
00:00:23,541 --> 00:00:25,875
Whether Chairman Huang's death
will affect the investigation…

7
00:00:25,958 --> 00:00:27,250
NOTHING IS SO BEAUTIFUL AS SPRING

8
00:00:27,333 --> 00:00:28,791
…has not been determined.

9
00:00:28,875 --> 00:00:30,291
In other news, Mayor-elect…

10
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:31,708
"EARLY SPRING RAIN" BY HAN YU

11
00:00:31,791 --> 00:00:33,583
…Tristan Hsueh is about to take office.

12
00:00:33,666 --> 00:00:37,958
Today, he attended a charity event
in preparation for his inauguration.

13
00:00:38,041 --> 00:00:42,250
Mayor-elect Hsueh announced that future
policies will prioritize the citizens…

14
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:45,375
-God damn it! Traitors!
-He will also strive…

15
00:00:45,458 --> 00:00:46,500
No sense of honor.

16
00:00:46,583 --> 00:00:48,791
One thing to your face,
another behind your back.

17
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:50,500
Don't be so angry.

18
00:00:51,083 --> 00:00:54,416
Young people these days,
they're not like they used to be.

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,583
Forget about honor.
Just watch out they don't turn on you.

20
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:58,750
Fuck!

21
00:00:58,833 --> 00:01:01,208
I treated him like a brother.
He treated me like dirt.

22
00:01:01,291 --> 00:01:02,916
Fuck that!

23
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
We hope to be able to rebuild

24
00:01:08,083 --> 00:01:10,291
and become a more caring society.

25
00:01:10,791 --> 00:01:14,041
But this city's transformation's
not down to the mayor alone.

26
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:19,166
Only with the people's hard work
and wise counsel can this be achieved.

27
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:22,708
THE FIXERS

28
00:01:40,375 --> 00:01:43,750
PRIMORDIAL FILES

29
00:01:43,833 --> 00:01:46,416
-Congratulations on taking office.
-Thank you.

30
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:49,291
Everyone's efforts got us
to where we are today.

31
00:01:49,375 --> 00:01:52,291
-You have our full support, sir.
-Congratulations, Mayor Hsueh.

32
00:01:52,375 --> 00:01:53,458
-Miss Lu.
-Wow!

33
00:01:53,541 --> 00:01:55,625
-The student surpassed the teacher.
-Thanks.

34
00:01:55,708 --> 00:01:57,708
Your father has a successor.

35
00:01:57,791 --> 00:02:00,208
My dad always says
I can learn a lot from you.

36
00:02:00,291 --> 00:02:01,833
Mmm, don't say that.

37
00:02:01,916 --> 00:02:04,875
So, the case is now in your hands.

38
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:08,541
-Let's find a good day to talk, all right?
-I look forward to it.

39
00:02:10,916 --> 00:02:13,125
How are you? You settling into it?

40
00:02:13,625 --> 00:02:15,958
I do start to wonder

41
00:02:16,041 --> 00:02:18,250
if acting's just natural,

42
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,083
or due to training.

43
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:24,250
I know you don't like these events.

44
00:02:29,666 --> 00:02:32,166
You heard anything further about the key?

45
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:33,375
It's dealt with.

46
00:02:34,208 --> 00:02:37,333
-Now wait for the handover.
-Come on.

47
00:02:38,375 --> 00:02:40,125
-Minister.
-Mayor, hello.

48
00:02:40,208 --> 00:02:43,958
I'd like you to meet someone.
This is my brother Louis.

49
00:02:44,041 --> 00:02:45,416
-Hello, Louis.
-Hello.

50
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:48,333
-I look forward to us working together.
-And so do I.

51
00:02:51,958 --> 00:02:53,333
DOUBLE HAPPINESS

52
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:12,000
CHING HE TEMPLE OF TZU YUN CLIFF

53
00:03:12,083 --> 00:03:15,458
MAYOR, TRISTAN HSUEH, MING YOUNG PARTY

54
00:03:17,291 --> 00:03:19,916
I believe Ching He Temple
has always been a place

55
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,875
where citizens gather in faith and virtue.

56
00:03:23,541 --> 00:03:25,458
Today, I came here to pray,

57
00:03:25,541 --> 00:03:28,916
because I want Ching He's new start here

58
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,500
to align with our fortune.

59
00:03:33,041 --> 00:03:34,541
Welcome back.

60
00:03:38,166 --> 00:03:41,250
Have these two keys for your safekeeping,

61
00:03:41,833 --> 00:03:42,958
Madam Chair.

62
00:03:43,875 --> 00:03:45,833
Thank you for all your hard work.

63
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:48,625
You deserve a rest.

64
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,125
So, on behalf of the new government,

65
00:03:57,208 --> 00:03:59,500
I hope that all future initiatives

66
00:03:59,583 --> 00:04:02,000
align with the real concerns of everyone.

67
00:04:27,958 --> 00:04:31,541
CELESTIAL

68
00:06:07,083 --> 00:06:09,000
CELESTIAL

69
00:06:19,625 --> 00:06:25,166
You must take back
the position that belongs to you.

70
00:06:25,666 --> 00:06:31,375
Only you are qualified
to be Fixer Celestial.

71
00:06:34,916 --> 00:06:39,583
Make both sides of the law be afraid.

72
00:06:40,708 --> 00:06:43,500
And make sure they respect you.

73
00:07:15,791 --> 00:07:18,583
After entering Kuang Ming Chamber,

74
00:07:18,666 --> 00:07:21,833
find the compass of Primordial Files.

75
00:07:22,833 --> 00:07:25,625
Align the dials in this specific order.

76
00:07:25,708 --> 00:07:26,791
PRIMORDIUM

77
00:07:27,375 --> 00:07:28,208
FROST'S DESCENT

78
00:07:28,291 --> 00:07:30,041
East, Frost's Descent.

79
00:07:30,541 --> 00:07:32,875
West, year 1909.

80
00:07:32,958 --> 00:07:33,916
YEAR 1909

81
00:07:34,875 --> 00:07:37,458
South, morning hours five to seven.

82
00:07:37,541 --> 00:07:38,583
MORNING HOURS FIVE TO SEVEN

83
00:07:38,666 --> 00:07:40,375
True North.

84
00:07:40,458 --> 00:07:41,333
TRUE

85
00:07:41,416 --> 00:07:43,666
With this passcode,

86
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:48,791
you can enter the secret tunnel
to the Primordial Files.

87
00:07:49,375 --> 00:07:53,708
This date marks the day
Liao Tien-ting faked his death

88
00:07:53,791 --> 00:07:57,625
and re-emerged
as the first Fixer Primordium.

89
00:07:59,041 --> 00:08:02,166
Only
the Fixer Celestial and Fixer Primordium

90
00:08:02,250 --> 00:08:05,000
have access to the secret tunnel.

91
00:08:05,083 --> 00:08:07,416
Forced entry would trigger

92
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:11,375
the destruction of the Primordial Files.

93
00:08:11,875 --> 00:08:14,583
But,
if the Primordial Files are controlled…

94
00:08:14,666 --> 00:08:18,041
If she reclaims Ching He,
she'll have absolute control.

95
00:08:18,125 --> 00:08:20,875
The balance of the scales
will be disturbed.

96
00:08:21,708 --> 00:08:24,166
The files will give us
the necessary power.

97
00:08:24,250 --> 00:08:27,250
We'd have influence
on both sides of the law… of the law…

98
00:08:27,333 --> 00:08:29,708
Then neither Ching He nor Yeh Yueh Tong…

99
00:08:29,791 --> 00:08:32,333
If I take over Ching He,
how do I deal with Madam Fan?

100
00:08:32,416 --> 00:08:34,708
…could ever threaten the Hsueh clan.

101
00:08:43,166 --> 00:08:45,791
And the genie won't go back in the bottle.

102
00:08:45,875 --> 00:08:48,291
Let the next head of Ching He
worry about that.

103
00:08:51,041 --> 00:08:53,583
What will occur when the Hsueh family

104
00:08:53,666 --> 00:08:55,416
find out about the video?

105
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:57,666
They must find out who else knows.

106
00:08:58,166 --> 00:09:00,041
And do you think they'll be spared?

107
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,375
SEVERAL DAYS AGO

108
00:09:03,458 --> 00:09:06,750
If the right side of the law
gets their hands on the files,

109
00:09:06,833 --> 00:09:09,125
their power will expand hugely.

110
00:09:10,291 --> 00:09:12,500
They go to the wrong side of the law,

111
00:09:13,625 --> 00:09:15,250
we'll see anarchy everywhere.

112
00:09:16,250 --> 00:09:18,250
Only by holding each other in check

113
00:09:18,333 --> 00:09:22,583
can you truly protect
the Hsueh family, your partner

114
00:09:23,583 --> 00:09:25,291
and Ching He.

115
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,416
You're not wrong.

116
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:33,375
But the Primordial Files were never
in your possession, right?

117
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:38,166
My brother mentioned the secret tunnel
where the files are hidden.

118
00:09:38,250 --> 00:09:40,000
Only Madam Fan knows how to open it.

119
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:43,208
No wonder you wanna catch her.

120
00:09:43,791 --> 00:09:45,083
Do you have a plan?

121
00:09:48,666 --> 00:09:51,250
Damn! We won't get
a chance like that again.

122
00:09:51,333 --> 00:09:52,250
Fuck!

123
00:10:03,625 --> 00:10:06,000
Sir Hong. You're a traitor as well.

124
00:10:06,916 --> 00:10:09,291
I thank you on behalf of the chairman.

125
00:10:18,541 --> 00:10:21,541
Lunar will definitely kill me.

126
00:10:23,375 --> 00:10:25,416
I need you to help protect me.

127
00:10:35,083 --> 00:10:37,958
So you and the chairman
colluded on a plan

128
00:10:38,458 --> 00:10:40,875
to get the Primordial Files from Fan?

129
00:10:41,416 --> 00:10:43,875
Gold stopped you killing Lunar.

130
00:10:43,958 --> 00:10:45,333
He had good reason.

131
00:10:47,375 --> 00:10:49,375
So you all had it planned out?

132
00:10:50,291 --> 00:10:53,083
It might make more sense if he tells you.

133
00:10:58,541 --> 00:10:59,666
Motherfucker!

134
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:02,000
You kept us in the dark all this time.

135
00:11:03,791 --> 00:11:07,000
Madam Fan would have found out
if I hadn't done it.

136
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:11,166
I got a plan where we all get out safely.

137
00:11:11,666 --> 00:11:12,916
I need you to join us.

138
00:11:21,666 --> 00:11:22,833
Welcome back.

139
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:27,875
Have these two keys for your safekeeping,

140
00:11:28,833 --> 00:11:30,250
Madam Chair.

141
00:11:31,041 --> 00:11:32,750
Thank you for all your hard work.

142
00:11:34,041 --> 00:11:35,666
You deserve a rest.

143
00:11:40,583 --> 00:11:42,083
wind gusting]

144
00:12:11,625 --> 00:12:12,875
Hands in the air.

145
00:12:15,083 --> 00:12:16,541
Get out of the car.

146
00:12:26,166 --> 00:12:27,875
Consider what you're doing.

147
00:12:28,416 --> 00:12:30,083
Madam Fan's with Ching He.

148
00:12:34,625 --> 00:12:36,416
I'll ask you one last time.

149
00:12:37,208 --> 00:12:38,916
Where are the case files?

150
00:12:41,166 --> 00:12:42,875
What do you want the files for?

151
00:12:48,750 --> 00:12:50,250
She does things,

152
00:12:50,916 --> 00:12:53,416
brutally and hastily.

153
00:12:54,916 --> 00:12:56,958
I was right in my conjecture.

154
00:12:57,541 --> 00:12:59,250
You've worked for her all this time.

155
00:12:59,833 --> 00:13:01,083
How come you don't get it?

156
00:13:02,583 --> 00:13:05,208
I can see what kind of person she is.

157
00:13:07,666 --> 00:13:10,125
Of all those who have done
bad deeds for her,

158
00:13:11,250 --> 00:13:13,916
are there any still here with us?

159
00:13:16,375 --> 00:13:17,791
Before you kill me,

160
00:13:18,750 --> 00:13:21,833
think carefully about
the person you're following.

161
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,083
Huh.

162
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:16,291
PRIMORDIUM

163
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:51,833
I can't believe it.

164
00:15:51,916 --> 00:15:53,916
Being mayor is not enough for you?

165
00:15:54,583 --> 00:15:56,541
You should have known beforehand.

166
00:15:57,750 --> 00:16:01,041
Oh, I did.
But I didn't think you'd be so impatient.

167
00:16:01,875 --> 00:16:03,833
And you're doing it yourself.

168
00:16:03,916 --> 00:16:05,250
I learned the hard way.

169
00:16:06,541 --> 00:16:08,708
The important things
you need to do yourself.

170
00:16:09,208 --> 00:16:11,166
Then there's no messy loose ends.

171
00:16:12,416 --> 00:16:16,708
You believe that, alone,
you can take charge of Ching He?

172
00:16:16,791 --> 00:16:18,833
The other six leaders.

173
00:16:19,875 --> 00:16:21,625
They'll be hard to deal with.

174
00:16:21,708 --> 00:16:24,291
Who told you
I want to take charge of Ching He?

175
00:16:25,666 --> 00:16:28,833
You were right.
One in the light, one in the dark.

176
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Huh.

177
00:16:33,583 --> 00:16:34,666
You chose Louis.

178
00:16:39,541 --> 00:16:42,625
Killing a leader
in the Kuang Ming chamber of Ching He.

179
00:16:43,375 --> 00:16:45,958
-You are aware of the consequences?
-Maybe.

180
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,333
I guess I'll find out.

181
00:16:57,375 --> 00:16:58,750
A last wish.

182
00:17:00,833 --> 00:17:02,625
Let me go in for a look.

183
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,166
Sorry. I'm not doing that.

184
00:17:24,625 --> 00:17:26,125
I had no choice.

185
00:17:28,041 --> 00:17:29,375
It had to be done.

186
00:18:14,666 --> 00:18:17,458
He's here. Hello, Mayor.

187
00:18:19,291 --> 00:18:21,041
Ah, hello there.

188
00:18:21,541 --> 00:18:23,000
So good you're here.

189
00:18:23,708 --> 00:18:25,291
I just brewed the tea.

190
00:18:25,375 --> 00:18:26,708
Can I offer you a cup?

191
00:18:27,958 --> 00:18:30,208
What's wrong?

192
00:18:30,291 --> 00:18:33,791
Are you surprised the passageway
brought you back to this hall,

193
00:18:33,875 --> 00:18:35,750
or are you surprised to see me?

194
00:18:53,458 --> 00:18:55,166
Sir Hong asked me to give you this.

195
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:57,000
And, this stamp.

196
00:18:58,166 --> 00:19:01,916
Once you ingest it,
it'll temporarily stop your heart.

197
00:19:19,916 --> 00:19:21,083
Tea?

198
00:19:46,875 --> 00:19:48,416
Aah!

199
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:52,625
So now San He's become Thackery's lackey?

200
00:19:53,291 --> 00:19:55,375
You've been invited to drink tea.

201
00:19:55,458 --> 00:19:57,083
so drink the fucking tea.

202
00:19:57,166 --> 00:19:59,916
Kindness begets kindness,
and wrongs, wrongs.

203
00:20:05,583 --> 00:20:06,583
Chairman.

204
00:20:07,791 --> 00:20:09,000
Can I smoke?

205
00:20:09,083 --> 00:20:10,291
Sure.

206
00:20:11,250 --> 00:20:13,500
You'll be the first.

207
00:20:14,291 --> 00:20:16,166
By summoning these people,

208
00:20:16,666 --> 00:20:18,375
does that mean
you're not letting me leave?

209
00:20:19,875 --> 00:20:24,833
Mayor, your decision will determine
whether you leave or stay.

210
00:20:29,708 --> 00:20:31,000
Pin.

211
00:20:31,083 --> 00:20:34,000
Please take these gentlemen
to the temple entrance.

212
00:20:34,583 --> 00:20:36,625
I don't want anyone coming in.

213
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:54,708
Mayor.

214
00:20:55,208 --> 00:20:56,291
Here's the thing.

215
00:20:56,791 --> 00:20:59,375
Don't be fooled
by the tranquility in here.

216
00:20:59,458 --> 00:21:01,333
Outside, a storm is raging.

217
00:21:02,375 --> 00:21:04,541
Everyone's hard at work.

218
00:23:20,166 --> 00:23:21,666
Yaah!

219
00:23:25,375 --> 00:23:26,750
Yaah!

220
00:25:00,541 --> 00:25:03,250
You can't hold a gun steady.

221
00:25:03,333 --> 00:25:04,708
Why even try?

222
00:25:07,708 --> 00:25:09,083
Hah!

223
00:25:09,708 --> 00:25:11,833
Do you know what my symptoms are?

224
00:25:14,583 --> 00:25:16,708
If I hold still…

225
00:25:16,791 --> 00:25:18,458
…everything shakes.

226
00:25:19,958 --> 00:25:21,208
Aah.

227
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:46,125
Fuck!

228
00:25:56,083 --> 00:25:59,583
If I move while holding something,
it doesn't shake.

229
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,041
You fat fuck!

230
00:26:02,541 --> 00:26:03,958
Fuck you! Aah!

231
00:26:10,666 --> 00:26:13,958
Look on my works, ye mighty, and despair.

232
00:26:14,041 --> 00:26:17,125
This one shot is the best of my career.

233
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:20,041
Chi!

234
00:26:20,625 --> 00:26:21,458
Aah!

235
00:26:21,541 --> 00:26:23,083
I fucking did it!

236
00:26:24,666 --> 00:26:26,541
Aah.

237
00:26:40,791 --> 00:26:42,291
So many tricks.

238
00:26:43,500 --> 00:26:45,125
Was that even the real entrance?

239
00:26:47,458 --> 00:26:52,833
We originally wanted to invite Madam Fan
to that passageway for a stroll.

240
00:26:52,916 --> 00:26:55,041
CELESTIAL

241
00:27:12,666 --> 00:27:14,291
PRIMORDIUM

242
00:27:33,166 --> 00:27:35,583
CELESTIAL

243
00:27:43,458 --> 00:27:45,125
CELESTIAL

244
00:28:48,291 --> 00:28:49,958
Have you been partners all along?

245
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:52,583
Aah.

246
00:28:53,583 --> 00:28:55,000
I dealt with Fan

247
00:28:56,208 --> 00:28:57,916
so you could take control of Ching He.

248
00:28:59,583 --> 00:29:02,125
But you colluded with Thackery
to betray me.

249
00:29:16,208 --> 00:29:18,625
This is a video
from Hsu Ming-yi's dashcam.

250
00:29:23,041 --> 00:29:24,125
You lied to me.

251
00:29:24,208 --> 00:29:26,791
Hsu Ming-yi wasn't killed by Dad.

252
00:29:39,583 --> 00:29:42,541
-This should be enough, right?
-Sir.

253
00:29:43,791 --> 00:29:45,333
I'm not that kind of person.

254
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,541
I'm not after money.

255
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,125
Then what is it?

256
00:29:56,583 --> 00:29:59,125
I've been a legislative aide a long time,

257
00:29:59,208 --> 00:30:01,708
hoping that one day,
I could be a legislator.

258
00:30:03,208 --> 00:30:05,083
But I don't have the background.

259
00:30:05,166 --> 00:30:06,583
I can't get elected.

260
00:30:08,333 --> 00:30:09,333
But maybe…

261
00:30:10,625 --> 00:30:13,375
if the Hsueh clan…
if they were to back me…

262
00:30:13,958 --> 00:30:15,458
then I'd have a shot at it.

263
00:30:16,625 --> 00:30:18,791
Are you threatening me now?

264
00:30:20,416 --> 00:30:23,083
If the truth about
the Hsueh clan's involvement

265
00:30:23,166 --> 00:30:26,791
in the Hsin Nan Redevelopment Zone
were to come out…

266
00:30:27,666 --> 00:30:28,708
What do you think?

267
00:30:29,375 --> 00:30:32,666
Would you be able to look at me
and do a deal?

268
00:30:41,166 --> 00:30:43,333
Do you know what it takes to get this far?

269
00:30:44,708 --> 00:30:46,333
To get where I am now?

270
00:30:46,958 --> 00:30:50,291
That is exactly why collaborating with me

271
00:30:50,375 --> 00:30:51,833
would suit us both.

272
00:30:53,875 --> 00:30:54,958
Hmm?

273
00:30:59,416 --> 00:31:00,750
Think carefully.

274
00:31:01,875 --> 00:31:02,958
Hi, sweetie.

275
00:31:04,708 --> 00:31:06,041
Nothin'.

276
00:31:06,125 --> 00:31:07,625
Just talkin' with the councillor.

277
00:31:11,583 --> 00:31:13,083
Okay. I'll be back soon.

278
00:31:13,666 --> 00:31:15,500
Hey, don't worry.

279
00:31:15,583 --> 00:31:17,333
Huh?

280
00:31:17,416 --> 00:31:18,791
Yeah. I… I know.

281
00:31:18,875 --> 00:31:20,166
Fuck!

282
00:31:22,166 --> 00:31:23,750
I don't do deals.

283
00:31:23,833 --> 00:31:24,666
I don't do deals.

284
00:31:24,750 --> 00:31:26,958
I don't do deals. I don't do deals!

285
00:31:30,416 --> 00:31:32,500
Hello? Hello? Honey?

286
00:31:32,583 --> 00:31:33,708
Is something wrong?

287
00:31:33,791 --> 00:31:34,666
ZOE

288
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:36,708
What was that sound? What's happened?

289
00:31:46,333 --> 00:31:48,750
You were worried
something like this would turn up,

290
00:31:48,833 --> 00:31:53,083
so you went to Yeh Yueh Tong to clean up
any evidence that could point to you.

291
00:31:53,666 --> 00:31:56,458
And then to get rid of
anyone who knew anything.

292
00:31:57,208 --> 00:32:00,708
All this time, you weren't trying
to cover up Dad's scandal.

293
00:32:01,375 --> 00:32:04,166
You were trying to protect
your own political career.

294
00:32:06,625 --> 00:32:10,333
Do you think I had to do nothing
to get where I am today?

295
00:32:11,291 --> 00:32:12,750
People think

296
00:32:13,375 --> 00:32:15,958
all that I achieved was down to Dad.

297
00:32:16,041 --> 00:32:17,958
They don't see what I've done.

298
00:32:21,083 --> 00:32:24,208
That Hsu Ming-yi guy
thought he had some dirt on me.

299
00:32:24,291 --> 00:32:27,333
Could use me
as a stepping stone to climb up.

300
00:32:30,916 --> 00:32:32,458
I'm not like you.

301
00:32:32,541 --> 00:32:34,750
My margin for error is nil.

302
00:32:35,833 --> 00:32:37,166
So Dad knows nothing about it?

303
00:32:39,625 --> 00:32:40,875
You know something?

304
00:32:41,416 --> 00:32:43,125
Sometimes I envy you.

305
00:32:43,208 --> 00:32:44,791
You can do whatever you want.

306
00:32:45,916 --> 00:32:47,833
But that you'd betray me…

307
00:32:47,916 --> 00:32:49,666
My brother, out of everyone…

308
00:32:49,750 --> 00:32:51,000
It's a shock.

309
00:32:54,041 --> 00:32:57,208
This is the only way
that Ching He and the Hsueh clan

310
00:32:57,291 --> 00:32:59,708
can achieve a balance
between the three parties.

311
00:32:59,791 --> 00:33:02,666
How can you talk about balance
when you've joined forces with Ching He?

312
00:33:06,041 --> 00:33:07,666
I just found this in the Primordial Files.

313
00:33:07,750 --> 00:33:10,041
CASE FILE, DOUBLE SHADOW
TOP SECRET, THACKERY HUANG

314
00:33:13,583 --> 00:33:17,583
I was originally just looking for
case files to use as a bargaining chip.

315
00:33:18,916 --> 00:33:20,750
JIANGNAN, PRIMORDIUM, 1984
CELESTIAL ACCESS ONLY

316
00:33:20,833 --> 00:33:23,333
But then I found
something related to you, Solar.

317
00:33:23,916 --> 00:33:26,208
CASE FILE, DOUBLE SHADOW
TOP SECRET, THACKERY HUANG

318
00:33:26,291 --> 00:33:27,666
You commissioned Primordium…

319
00:33:27,750 --> 00:33:28,708
THACKERY HUANG

320
00:33:28,791 --> 00:33:32,375
…to conveniently frame Madam Fan's dad
for the death of a Fixer.

321
00:33:34,916 --> 00:33:37,666
We have discovered the Fixer's death

322
00:33:37,750 --> 00:33:41,750
is connected all the way back to you.

323
00:33:42,291 --> 00:33:44,875
And so we must postpone the handover

324
00:33:44,958 --> 00:33:48,666
of the position of Fixer Celestial
to your daughter.

325
00:33:53,083 --> 00:33:55,291
And that was just one of your many tricks.

326
00:33:59,333 --> 00:34:01,708
No wonder you wanted
to get the files so badly.

327
00:34:01,791 --> 00:34:04,041
You wanted to destroy the evidence.

328
00:34:05,166 --> 00:34:07,500
If any of this information were to leak,

329
00:34:07,583 --> 00:34:10,458
the authorities would
end up having a field day.

330
00:34:15,666 --> 00:34:17,666
I didn't expect you'd make threats.

331
00:34:18,916 --> 00:34:21,000
The third party you mentioned

332
00:34:21,083 --> 00:34:22,583
is you, I'm guessing.

333
00:34:23,083 --> 00:34:24,208
It's not a threat.

334
00:34:24,291 --> 00:34:25,791
It's balance.

335
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:29,750
If any one party upsets the balance,

336
00:34:30,375 --> 00:34:32,541
there is a corresponding reckoning.

337
00:34:37,291 --> 00:34:39,083
You were always the smart one.

338
00:34:40,083 --> 00:34:43,666
That's why I let you play around.
Not get too serious.

339
00:34:43,750 --> 00:34:46,625
Because I knew once you did,
you would then be my greatest problem.

340
00:34:51,291 --> 00:34:52,458
So from now,

341
00:34:53,041 --> 00:34:56,875
Ching He can rely
on the Hsueh clan for support.

342
00:34:58,833 --> 00:35:00,166
Do I have an option?

343
00:35:01,125 --> 00:35:03,625
One moved the pieces.
The other swung the blade.

344
00:35:05,166 --> 00:35:07,166
I'm just going with the flow.

345
00:35:09,083 --> 00:35:13,041
I've also been checked by his pawn.

346
00:35:16,416 --> 00:35:18,500
You really are better at everything.

347
00:35:19,375 --> 00:35:22,875
I always said that one day,
I would help the Hsueh clan.

348
00:35:23,541 --> 00:35:25,708
But I'd do it in the way I thought right.

349
00:35:25,791 --> 00:35:29,125
Lines get blurry in this life

350
00:35:29,208 --> 00:35:31,750
You're forced into the side

351
00:35:36,625 --> 00:35:39,500
I, I see right through you

352
00:36:12,791 --> 00:36:14,333
Howie.

353
00:36:14,416 --> 00:36:16,416
Tell your mom it's all fine, huh?

354
00:36:16,916 --> 00:36:20,875
Ah, you should have seen
how cool your dad was just now.

355
00:36:20,958 --> 00:36:22,958
Aah!

356
00:36:23,041 --> 00:36:25,250
I'll come get you later.

357
00:36:25,333 --> 00:36:28,333
We are going home. Huh?

358
00:36:30,416 --> 00:36:32,625
Hey. They let you go again?

359
00:36:34,916 --> 00:36:36,958
What? You miss me?

360
00:36:38,541 --> 00:36:40,416
I can't wait to get rid of you.

361
00:36:40,500 --> 00:36:41,666
Get in.

362
00:36:42,625 --> 00:36:44,125
I brought some buns.

363
00:36:48,333 --> 00:36:50,208
You fucking with me again?

364
00:37:01,208 --> 00:37:02,625
Aah.

365
00:37:03,416 --> 00:37:05,958
This life's tough, but I'm tougher.

366
00:37:06,041 --> 00:37:09,500
If the noodle business falls through,
I'd come back to all this.

367
00:37:10,125 --> 00:37:13,416
Nobody gets out
without a few scars, anyway.

368
00:37:14,166 --> 00:37:17,458
Mmm! We could get back
in the saddle if all else fails.

369
00:37:18,750 --> 00:37:19,750
Oh.

370
00:37:19,833 --> 00:37:22,166
Scallion one is still the best, isn't it?

371
00:37:26,875 --> 00:37:28,708
ARCADE

372
00:37:36,875 --> 00:37:38,000
Where to from here?

373
00:37:39,458 --> 00:37:40,958
I wanna study abroad.

374
00:37:42,083 --> 00:37:43,416
Get a fresh start.

375
00:37:47,166 --> 00:37:48,208
Fan's death…

376
00:37:49,125 --> 00:37:50,125
How will you handle that?

377
00:37:53,125 --> 00:37:55,291
They'll only know Madam Fan's missing.

378
00:37:58,583 --> 00:37:59,500
And you?

379
00:38:00,333 --> 00:38:01,875
Will you stay with Ching He?

380
00:38:02,375 --> 00:38:05,000
I'm the only one both sides won't touch.

381
00:38:05,083 --> 00:38:08,083
If I stay, balance will be maintained.

382
00:38:08,166 --> 00:38:10,166
Then won't you get stuck there?

383
00:38:10,666 --> 00:38:13,458
Huh? Should I sell noodles
with you instead?

384
00:38:14,041 --> 00:38:15,250
It's an option.

385
00:38:17,250 --> 00:38:20,958
So the person finding it
hardest to leave is you.

386
00:38:28,625 --> 00:38:30,250
I should go now.

387
00:38:44,958 --> 00:38:46,041
See you around.

388
00:38:54,666 --> 00:38:58,333
I've left Ben's stall to you.
Take care of it. Bye now.

389
00:39:18,666 --> 00:39:19,583
Hey.

390
00:39:20,166 --> 00:39:21,125
You goin' after her?

391
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,708
It's not a romantic drama, is it?

392
00:39:24,458 --> 00:39:26,208
Shouldn't you go see a doctor?

393
00:39:26,291 --> 00:39:27,291
Take me, then.

394
00:39:29,083 --> 00:39:30,083
Let's go.

395
00:39:31,250 --> 00:39:32,250
Aah.

396
00:39:32,875 --> 00:39:34,541
So moody, this kid.

397
00:39:41,750 --> 00:39:43,458
To maintain balance,

398
00:39:43,541 --> 00:39:46,291
you need the black,
the white, and the gray.

399
00:39:46,375 --> 00:39:49,416
Is this what you came up with
to protect your brother?

400
00:39:50,666 --> 00:39:53,833
Delete all of Yeh Yueh Tong's
closed case files.

401
00:39:54,625 --> 00:39:56,833
Ching He has leverage over my brother.

402
00:39:57,666 --> 00:39:59,583
And I have leverage over them.

403
00:39:59,666 --> 00:40:02,375
This is the only way
balance can be achieved.

404
00:40:03,125 --> 00:40:04,291
Who's saying this?

405
00:40:05,541 --> 00:40:07,166
Ching He's Fixer Gold?

406
00:40:08,375 --> 00:40:10,666
Or the Hsueh clan's second son?

407
00:40:14,041 --> 00:40:15,333
It's Louis.

408
00:40:52,666 --> 00:40:54,583
I'm not sure if you can hear.

409
00:40:55,666 --> 00:40:58,500
No doubt you'd say
that I betrayed Tristan.

410
00:41:01,791 --> 00:41:05,125
All my life, I've tried
to prove that I'm his equal.

411
00:41:06,541 --> 00:41:09,416
But after all this,
I've realized it wasn't worth it.

412
00:41:10,666 --> 00:41:13,375
Spending all that time settling scores.

413
00:41:25,583 --> 00:41:27,500
If you see Mom up there,

414
00:41:28,583 --> 00:41:29,916
be nicer to her.

415
00:41:41,916 --> 00:41:46,166
I have to say, your departure is
a great loss to Ching He.

416
00:41:46,250 --> 00:41:47,166
Oh!

417
00:41:47,250 --> 00:41:49,916
And you just got your marksmanship back.

418
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,541
Why would you want to turn your--

419
00:41:51,625 --> 00:41:53,041
It's time to retire.

420
00:41:53,125 --> 00:41:55,416
This illness is just going to get worse.

421
00:41:55,500 --> 00:41:57,625
And my son's starting senior high.

422
00:41:57,708 --> 00:41:59,625
Once they go to college, it's goodbye.

423
00:41:59,708 --> 00:42:02,166
So he and I have got three good years.

424
00:42:02,916 --> 00:42:04,125
That's true.

425
00:42:04,208 --> 00:42:07,041
Honestly, though,
if it weren't for your help,

426
00:42:07,125 --> 00:42:10,166
Ching He couldn't have
restored its stability.

427
00:42:11,291 --> 00:42:13,208
You hear that?

428
00:42:16,750 --> 00:42:17,666
Ah, Sir Hong.

429
00:42:17,750 --> 00:42:20,750
How's your arm? Is it all right?

430
00:42:20,833 --> 00:42:23,000
It is. I've had worse.

431
00:42:23,750 --> 00:42:27,625
The money should definitely
be enough to comfortably retire.

432
00:42:27,708 --> 00:42:31,041
-As long as you remember…
-Don't disclose anything about Ching He.

433
00:42:31,125 --> 00:42:34,000
I know that. Don't you worry.

434
00:42:34,500 --> 00:42:36,333
When I can, I'll come back to pray.

435
00:42:36,416 --> 00:42:37,541
We'll drink tea together.

436
00:42:37,625 --> 00:42:39,666
-You won't have to miss me.
-Quit while you're ahead.

437
00:42:39,750 --> 00:42:41,500
-I'll walk you out.
-Right.

438
00:42:41,583 --> 00:42:42,500
Thank you.

439
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,125
Thank you, Chairman.

440
00:42:44,916 --> 00:42:46,250
Thank you, Sir Hong.

441
00:42:46,333 --> 00:42:48,500
-Take care.
-You too. Bye now.

442
00:42:52,458 --> 00:42:54,125
If you're feeling bored someday,

443
00:42:54,208 --> 00:42:56,250
come back
and we'll take on a case together.

444
00:42:56,333 --> 00:42:58,625
If you're ever bored, come to my place.

445
00:42:58,708 --> 00:43:00,375
I'll cook you a nice meal.

446
00:43:01,416 --> 00:43:02,916
Tomorrow sound okay?

447
00:43:03,916 --> 00:43:05,791
All right, then.

448
00:43:07,166 --> 00:43:10,375
All around, mountains and waters combine.
What's after that?

449
00:43:12,166 --> 00:43:13,375
Shit.

450
00:43:13,875 --> 00:43:15,750
Get yourself an education.

451
00:43:21,375 --> 00:43:23,000
You're not so divine!

452
00:43:43,083 --> 00:43:44,333
AUTHENTIC TIEN-BU-LA

453
00:43:44,416 --> 00:43:46,208
FELIX'S STIR-FRIED SWAMP EEL

454
00:43:52,916 --> 00:43:54,250
Hey, Howie.

455
00:43:54,333 --> 00:43:55,625
-Yeah?
-Come on.

456
00:43:55,708 --> 00:43:57,250
YOU GET A SWEET DEAL
MY SWAMP EEL NOODLES

457
00:43:57,333 --> 00:43:59,666
These noodles
and that tien-bu-la for the last table.

458
00:43:59,750 --> 00:44:01,083
-Got it.
-Okay?

459
00:44:04,291 --> 00:44:05,500
How do you like that?

460
00:44:05,583 --> 00:44:09,208
Your swamp eel noodles are so popular
that you're still open.

461
00:44:09,291 --> 00:44:11,333
Well, business is booming.

462
00:44:11,416 --> 00:44:13,000
There's a line all day.

463
00:44:13,083 --> 00:44:15,500
4.9 stars on Google.
How about that?

464
00:44:15,583 --> 00:44:16,916
Oh yeah, I saw.

465
00:44:17,000 --> 00:44:19,458
Don't reply online. Stop doing that.

466
00:44:19,541 --> 00:44:21,333
Don't blame me, it's the customers.

467
00:44:21,416 --> 00:44:23,041
They eat, then whine.

468
00:44:23,125 --> 00:44:24,166
Yeah, sure.

469
00:44:24,750 --> 00:44:27,208
Maybe I should bring my boyfriend.

470
00:44:27,291 --> 00:44:30,000
He's a really good cook.
He might show you up.

471
00:44:30,083 --> 00:44:34,208
Hey, what about, when Howie finishes
exams, we'll all come over there.

472
00:44:34,291 --> 00:44:36,500
I'll cook for you
and your foreign boyfriend.

473
00:44:36,583 --> 00:44:38,916
Where will you find swamp eel here?

474
00:44:39,000 --> 00:44:40,875
All right, see you. Bye.

475
00:44:41,541 --> 00:44:43,125
Hm.

476
00:44:43,750 --> 00:44:45,583
Pond loach. Check.

477
00:44:45,666 --> 00:44:47,125
-I've got it.
-Hey, wait.

478
00:44:47,208 --> 00:44:49,250
There's no need to pay.
On the house.

479
00:44:49,333 --> 00:44:51,625
-Hey, I feel bad about that.
-It's fine!

480
00:44:51,708 --> 00:44:53,916
Every meal's free.
You should feel terrible.

481
00:44:54,000 --> 00:44:54,916
Hey!

482
00:44:55,000 --> 00:44:56,416
Hey, hey. I really wanna pay.

483
00:44:56,500 --> 00:44:57,750
There's really no need.

484
00:44:57,833 --> 00:45:00,375
-You're incredible! Bye.
-See ya next time. Bye.

485
00:45:54,416 --> 00:45:58,375
Primordium. It's good
to see you after so long.

486
00:46:01,041 --> 00:46:03,000
PRIMORDIUM

487
00:46:05,333 --> 00:46:09,458
Fixer Primordium
does not report to anyone,

488
00:46:09,541 --> 00:46:11,708
not even Fixer Celestial.

489
00:46:12,791 --> 00:46:15,750
When Fixer Primordium reappears…

490
00:46:15,833 --> 00:46:18,000
YEH YUEH TONG WATCH LIST, S-TIER FIXER
MALE, AGE 36 TO 38

491
00:46:18,083 --> 00:46:20,166
…it signifies a momentous
historical event will unfold.

492
00:46:20,250 --> 00:46:21,416
STATUS: DECEASED

493
00:46:21,500 --> 00:46:22,750
STATUS: NORMAL

494
00:46:22,833 --> 00:46:24,750
FIXER WITH YEH YUEH TONG,
SPECIAL OPERATIONS UNIT

495
00:46:24,833 --> 00:46:26,041
RELATED PERSONS: UNKNOWN
